{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"PCA with varimax rotation of GI parameters from trials without FOG (1,130 trials) revealed 5 orthogonally RPC accounting for 73% of variance (see Fig 2C and Supplementary Fig S2).\",\n    \"We first examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and GI RPC scores in trials without FOG, in the DOPAOFF condition, in both patients with PD groups (Supplementary Fig S3).\",\n    \"STN‐LFPs data were first high‐pass filtered at 1 Hz, notch filtered at 50 Hz, and epoched from 2 seconds before the cue to the end of the second swing phase.\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"DOPAOFF, 12 patients with PD had FOG observed (FOG‐OBS, 263 episodes), occurring at a mean of 8 steps after GI, and 26 had no FOG observed (NOBS; FOG‐NOBS).\",\n    \"In the 12 FOG‐OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG‐OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G).\",\n    \"These FOG‐OBS patients also completed 212 walking trials without FOG (FOG‐OBS− trials; see Fig 1E).\",\n    \"In the 26 remaining patients with PD for which we observed no FOG episode, 918 trials were recorded (FOG‐NOBS, DOPAOFF; see Fig 1E).\",\n    \"GI kinetics and LFP signals were simultaneously recorded, synchronized, and exported for off‐line analyses using MATLAB (MathWorks Inc.) toolbox (http://biomechanical-toolkit.github.io).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG‐OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG‐OBS− trials) in FOG‐OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\",\n    \"Our results support the existence of a predisposed state for FOG at gait initiation, which may be partially mitigated through compensatory mechanisms involving widespread low‐beta modulations within the STN; and an actual occurrence of FOG, marked by an early modulation in high‐beta activity in the posterior STN.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两个说法均有全文依据，并不必然矛盾。报告的说法成立：DOPAOFF条件下，无冻结试次共1,130次（212次FOG-OBS阴性试次及918次FOG-NOBS试次），明显多于发生冻结的99次试次，因此说主要分析无冻结试次有依据。此外，LFP分析窗口截至步态启动后的第二摆动期，而冻结约在步态启动后第8步发生，因此研究没有提供冻结实际发生期间（During-FOG）的直接神经电活动记录。指控者的说法也成立：研究并非只分析无冻结试次，而是明确纳入99个随后实际发生FOG的试次，并将其与212个未发生FOG的试次比较，分析步态启动阶段与即将发生FOG相关的STN活动。因此，研究不仅涉及FOG易感性，也提供了冻结发生前的事件相关神经活动证据。需要区分的是，冻结前的预测性神经活动不等于冻结期间的直接神经活动。另一个统计细节：摘要将冻结发生时间表述为平均8步（mean），但结果正文报告为中位数8步（median，IQR 6–11.5）；指控者所说的第8步有依据，但平均数这一具体表述并非结果正文采用的统计量。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4bf1efd4-434e-4c86-81dc-e4e81b1b0ea2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104801231754Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:49:52.552511+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7ff075af0994de430f0ed67252f7db926e1908c0a485e722d63d69779fa4bd4", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104801231754Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1a01b818067dc05903b06cc4e2d6339b2c0546caa37ededb4daeaaca4952a9b7"}}}
